 			       nWidth, nHeight, nLayerWidth, nLayerHeight, nBokehVertexCount, fNumApertureSides,
-			       fIrisExponent, dofParams.fBladeCurvature, dofParams.fBladeRotation,
+			       fIrisExponent, fIrisEdgeSoft, dofParams.fBladeCurvature, dofParams.fBladeRotation,
